From 63a549152fe450550c689bd84ddb59c645eded3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksii Horchynskyi <pan.alexeu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:58:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] gears2-nx SDK patches 0001-0049 (Unreal Engine 3 on
 deko3d)

Applied in order from gears2-nx (gow2/sdk-patches, BSD-3-Clause, the SDK's license) at its pin
f961303: commit granule, deko3d formats, flush mode, yield backoff, XMA locks, render target and
resolve fixes for UE3 (7e3 scene, EDRAM format aliases, clears), occlusion queries, DKSH cache.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CGstJFihyJYNUGR3QC7gUu
